B.cFL=new A.p("editedAtColumn",B.t,"Opt-in: date column stamped today alongside editedByColumn on a real edit.",B.f,null)
B.cEb=new A.p("valueLabels",B.X,'Opt-in (overviewsweep-0822), display-only: raw stored value \u2192 display text map (flat `{value: entry}` or column-keyed `{column: {value: entry}}`), each entry a plain string or a {lang: text} map. Used by the "chips" layout\'s inline "Label \xb7 value" chips so an enum/status column shows a translated word instead of the raw stored value under a non-English locale; the stored value itself is never touched. Same shape/precedence as the "cards" node\'s valueLabels.',B.f,null)
