B.cE9=new A.p("variant",B.bH,'Visual treatment: "dropdown" (default, compact menu) or "segmented" \u2014 a discoverable inline SegmentedButton, best for 2-5 short options (e.g. a Map/Table view switch) where a hidden dropdown would be too easy to miss. Segments are equal-width and never wrap or overflow.',B.bsC,null)
