B.cI4=new A.p("defaultValue",B.D,'A PRESENTATIONAL fallback value shown as "current" when nothing is set yet (selectedFrom/column empty) \u2014 never written, just displayed. Use when the control\'s true default already matches something drawn elsewhere (e.g. a map\'s initial paint), so the control can say so honestly instead of "nothing chosen".',B.f,null)
